WEBVTT

00:02:26.976 --> 00:02:33.232
and gleaned her tenacity

00:02:33.274 --> 00:02:34.901
which I borrowed,

00:02:36.652 --> 00:02:42.158
and her long suffering in her life
of constant work with seven children,

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.702
six of whom made it to adulthood.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:49.248
In a house without electricity.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.628
In the sweltering cotton fields,

00:02:53.669 --> 00:02:55.755
and I wrote these words about her.

00:02:55.796 --> 00:02:58.174
(Music)

00:02:58.174 --> 00:03:01.385
(Singing) Five cans of paint